Package: mxl-fabrics-proxy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ivan Chvets <ichvets@evertz.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: MXL fabrics proxy - carries MXL flows between DCs
 mxl-fabrics-proxy (https://github.com/jonasohland/mxl-fabrics-proxy),
 built natively and run as mxl-fabrics-proxy.service. The service starts
 once /opt/dreamcatcher/share/mxl/mxl-fabrics-proxy-config.yaml exists.
